### ─── STEP 2: Seed Data ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Run §1, §2, §3 in order to populate the three collections used by all
### subsequent examples. The laptops collection references memory and display
### collections via foreign keys — this enables the join examples below.

### §1. Seed the `memory` collection
### Each document describes a RAM module. Laptops reference these via `memory_id`.
POST http://localhost:1538/set
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "collection": "memory",
  "data": {
    "mem1": {
      "capacity_gb": 8,
      "type": "LPDDR5",
      "speed_mhz": 4266,
      "upgradeable": false
    },
    "mem2": {
      "capacity_gb": 16,
      "type": "LPDDR5",
      "speed_mhz": 4266,
      "upgradeable": false
    },
    "mem3": {
      "capacity_gb": 32,
      "type": "DDR5",
      "speed_mhz": 5600,
      "upgradeable": true
    },
    "mem4": {
      "capacity_gb": 64,
      "type": "DDR5",
      "speed_mhz": 5600,
      "upgradeable": true
    },
    "mem5": {
      "capacity_gb": 36,
      "type": "Unified",
      "speed_mhz": 6400,
      "upgradeable": false
    }
  }
}

### §2. Seed the `display` collection
### Each document describes a screen. Laptops reference these via `display_id`.
POST http://localhost:1538/set
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "collection": "display",
  "data": {
    "dsp1": {
      "size_inch": 13.3,
      "resolution": "2560x1600",
      "panel": "IPS",
      "refresh_hz": 60,
      "touchscreen": false,
      "hdr": false
    },
    "dsp2": {
      "size_inch": 14.0,
      "resolution": "2880x1800",
      "panel": "OLED",
      "refresh_hz": 90,
      "touchscreen": false,
      "hdr": true
    },
    "dsp3": {
      "size_inch": 15.6,
      "resolution": "1920x1080",
      "panel": "IPS",
      "refresh_hz": 144,
      "touchscreen": false,
      "hdr": false
    },
    "dsp4": {
      "size_inch": 16.2,
      "resolution": "3456x2234",
      "panel": "Mini-LED",
      "refresh_hz": 120,
      "touchscreen": false,
      "hdr": true
    },
    "dsp5": {
      "size_inch": 14.0,
      "resolution": "2560x1600",
      "panel": "IPS",
      "refresh_hz": 165,
      "touchscreen": true,
      "hdr": false
    }
  }
}

### §3. Seed the `laptops` collection
### Each laptop has nested specs AND foreign keys to memory + display collections.
### This single collection is used for all query examples below.
POST http://localhost:1538/set
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "collection": "laptops",
  "data": {
    "lp1": {
      "brand": "Lenovo",
      "model": "ThinkPad X1 Carbon",
      "price": 1499,
      "in_stock": true,
